S</tspan><tspan x=\"87.45\" y=\"0\"> </tspan></text><text class=\"story-block-1-cls-11\" transform=\"translate(102.35 102.5)\"><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-12\">E</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-4\" x=\"30.75\" y=\"0\">M</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-13\" x=\"73.9\" y=\"0\">P</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-14\" x=\"102.7\" y=\"0\">O</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-15\" x=\"142.3\" y=\"0\">W</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-12\" x=\"190.75\" y=\"0\">E</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-10\" x=\"221.5\" y=\"0\">R</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-4\" x=\"253.35\" y=\"0\">M</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-12\" x=\"296.5\" y=\"0\">E</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-16\" x=\"327.25\" y=\"0\">N</tspan><tspan x=\"364.25\" y=\"0\">T</tspan></text><text class=\"story-block-1-cls-9\" transform=\"translate(499.39 102.5)\">.</text><text class=\"story-block-1-cls-9\" transform=\"translate(0 162.5)\"><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-4\">I</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-10\" x=\"14\" y=\"0\">T'</tspan><tspan x=\"54\" y=\"0\">S</tspan></text><text class=\"story-block-1-cls-11\" transform=\"translate(87.55 162.5)\"><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-4\" xml:space=\"preserve\"> COMMUNI</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-1-cls-17\" x=\"259.35\" y=\"0\">T</tspan><tspan x=\"293.05\" y=\"0\">Y</tspan></text><text class=\"story-block-1-cls-9\" transform=\"translate(410.1 162.5)\">.</text></g></g></svg>",
            "half_wide_title": false,
            "text": "When you’ve worked in hospitality, it’s always going to be part of who you are. We cut our teeth with entrepreneurs out to make their mark on the world and we’re constantly inspired by the power and drive behind creators like you. From long hours to long days, we know what it takes to get up and running and — maybe even harder — to keep it going. \n<br>\n<br>\nThat’s why we look at you as colleagues, not clients. We’re all part of a community out to connect and empower. We do it through quality-crafted mugs, through cutting-edge design, and through supporting the people around us.",
            "btn_link": "",
            "btn_text": ""
          }
        },
        "bba4ca41-3453-48e5-9e86-2494a9f20735": {
          "type": "image_text",
          "settings": {
            "reverse": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Asset_5_2x-100.jpg",
            "title": "PEOPLE + PURPOSE. GIVING BACK TO OUR COMMUNITY.",
            "svg_title": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 323.31 58.34\"><defs><style>.story-block-2-cls-1{font-size:50px;font-family:Canela-Thin, Canela;font-weight:200;}.story-block-2-cls-2{letter-spacing:0.01em;}.story-block-2-cls-3{letter-spacing:0.02em;}.story-block-2-cls-4{font-size:52px;font-family:BasisGrotesquePro-OffWhite, Basis Grotesque Pro;letter-spacing:0.01em;}.story-block-2-cls-5{letter-spacing:-0.01em;}.story-block-2-cls-6{letter-spacing:0em;}.story-block-2-cls-7{letter-spacing:0em;}</style></defs><title>Asset 6</title>\n<g id=\"Layer_2\" data-name=\"Layer 2\"><g id=\"Layer_1-2\" data-name=\"Layer 1\"><text class=\"story-block-2-cls-1\" transform=\"translate(0 44.2)\"><tspan class=\"story-block-2-cls-2\">G</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-2-cls-3\" x=\"40.6\" y=\"0\">IVING</tspan><tspan x=\"176.5\" y=\"0\"> </tspan></text><text class=\"story-block-2-cls-4\" transform=\"translate(185 44.2)\">B<tspan class=\"story-block-2-cls-5\" x=\"33.9\" y=\"0\">A</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-2-cls-6\" x=\"67.29\" y=\"0\">C</tspan><tspan class=\"story-block-2-cls-7\" x=\"106.13\" y=\"0\">K</tspan></text></g></g></svg>",
            "half_wide_title": true,
            "text": "We’re created to do good in the world. By inspiring change in the immediate world around us, we can use the power of our influence as a force for good. We recognize one of the best ways to do that is by donating our dollar to charity : water. Every time you support us, we support guaranteeing safe and clean drinking water to people in developing countries around the world. \n<br>\n<br>\nWe chose charity : water because they embody our values of transparency, relationship, and long-term commitment to positive change.",
            "btn_link": "https://www.charitywater.org/global-water-crisis",
            "btn_text": "Learn More About Charity : Water"
          }
        },
