an><tspan class=\"story-cls-11\" x=\"540.13\" y=\"0\">G</tspan><tspan x=\"607.8\" y=\"0\">,</tspan></text><text class=\"story-cls-12\" transform=\"translate(0 170.85)\">a<tspan class=\"story-cls-13\" x=\"36.47\" y=\"0\">n</tspan><tspan x=\"75.02\" y=\"0\">d</tspan></text><text class=\"story-cls-8\" transform=\"translate(112.23 170.85)\"><tspan class=\"story-cls-10\"> </tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-14\" x=\"14.1\" y=\"0\">E</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-15\" x=\"65.42\" y=\"0\">M</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-16\" x=\"137.43\" y=\"0\">P</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-17\" x=\"185.5\" y=\"0\">O</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-18\" x=\"251.58\" y=\"0\">W</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-19\" x=\"332.44\" y=\"0\">E</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-20\" x=\"383.76\" y=\"0\">R</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-9\" x=\"436.91\" y=\"0\">ING</tspan><tspan x=\"588.45\" y=\"0\"> </tspan></text><text class=\"story-cls-1\" transform=\"translate(715.07 170.82)\"><tspan class=\"story-cls-7\">P</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-21\" x=\"58.09\" y=\"0\">E</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-22\" x=\"107.64\" y=\"0\">O</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-7\" x=\"175.23\" y=\"0\">P</tspan><tspan class=\"story-cls-23\" x=\"233.33\" y=\"0\">L</tspan><tspan x=\"280.87\" y=\"0\">E</tspan></text></g></g></svg>",
        "text_block_text": "Everyone was created for a purpose and seeking ours led us to Created Co. It’s our goal to help you discover — and rediscover — the creative, spiritual, and material endeavors that inspire you to show up, be big, and feel alive.\n<br>\n<br>\n\nThat’s what goes into what we do and we hope that when you pick up one of our products you feel that in the weight of the materials and the community behind it. \n<br>\n<br>\n\nWe’re here to help you create good in your community, in your art, in your business, and in our human connection.",
